    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Happened to the Miller Family?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just outside the quiet town of Coffeyville, Kansas, the Miller family\u2014mother Margaret, father Edward, and their 11-year-old daughter Lily\u2014suddenly vanished one night from their old farmhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authorities found no trace, signs, or evidence of forced entry during their investigation of the area. Shortly after the incident, strange rumors began to spread. Reports emerged of a girl resembling Lily being seen near the farmhouse at night, along with unsettling noises coming from the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Michael Wolf, a young journalist working for the town\u2019s local newspaper, decided to investigate the case after hearing these rumors. The claims of a girl resembling Lily appearing around the farmhouse at night compelled him to uncover the truth behind the family's mysterious disappearance.<br>And so, Michael set off toward the abandoned farmhouse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Is Lily Dead or Alive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened to Lily? Was she dead, murdered or kidnapped?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traces of The Past!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The diary entries Lily left behind are eerie and deeply disturbing! Are they a cry for help or demonic vengeance?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strange Sounds!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whispers, screams and spooky strange sounds. I wonder what they mean.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unexpected Truth?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could what's happening on this farm be real? Or is everything an illusion?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Happened to the Miller Family?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just outside the quiet town of Coffeyville, Kansas, the Miller family\u2014mother Margaret, father Edward, and their 11-year-old daughter Lily\u2014suddenly vanished one night from their old farmhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authorities found no trace, signs, or evidence of forced entry during their investigation of the area. Shortly after the incident, strange rumors began to spread. Reports emerged of a girl resembling Lily being seen near the farmhouse at night, along with unsettling noises coming from the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Michael Wolf, a young journalist working for the town\u2019s local newspaper, decided to investigate the case after hearing these rumors. The claims of a girl resembling Lily appearing around the farmhouse at night compelled him to uncover the truth behind the family's mysterious disappearance.<br>And so, Michael set off toward the abandoned farmhouse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Is Lily Dead or Alive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happened to Lily? Was she dead, murdered or kidnapped?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traces of The Past!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The diary entries Lily left behind are eerie and deeply disturbing! Are they a cry for help or demonic vengeance?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strange Sounds!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whispers, screams and spooky strange sounds. I wonder what they mean.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unexpected Truth?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Could what's happening on this farm be real? Or is everything an illusion?</p>",
